  Vendored rather than installed from npm so the example needs no JavaScript
  package step to run. It walks SHOW_COMMENT | SHOW_PROCESSING_INSTRUCTION,
  because a browser without native processing-instruction parsing delivers
  `<?marker name="x">` as a bogus comment whose data is `?marker name="x"` —
  so the same server bytes work on both the native and polyfilled paths.
